      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "When treated at a hospital unit, full-term and preterm neonatal infants undergo a large number of manipulations and procedures, most of them are rather painful; anesthesia is used inadequately frequently. Pain prevention during procedures is able to reduce a baby's discomfort and to improve his/her tolerance of medical manipulations and care procedures."},
